      en: ["The Menton lemon officially received PGI certification in 2015.", "The annual Fête du Citron attracts more than 200,000 visitors to the city.", "Approximately 140 tons of citrus fruits are used to create the festival displays.", "In the 18th century, the region exported about 40 million lemons annually.", "Groves are situated on traditional dry-stone terraces known as restanques.", "The fruit is harvested entirely by hand between January and April."],
