      en: ["The gorge extends for a total length of approximately 25 kilometers.", "The canyon reaches its maximum depth of 700 meters near the 'Point Sublime'.", "The Verdon River originates in the Alps at an altitude of 2,819 meters.", "The Lac de Sainte-Croix was created in 1974 following the construction of a dam.", "There are over 1,500 established climbing routes on the canyon's limestone cliffs.", "The famous Blanc-Martel trail is approximately 15 kilometers long one way."],
